Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:01.60,Alt,,0,0,0,,Rıza. Kaç para?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.25,0:00:02.80,Alt,,0,0,0,,Üç…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:04.30,Alt,,0,0,0,,Üç bin mi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:06.75,Alt,,0,0,0,,Üç yüz otuz üç bin…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:09.10,Alt,,0,0,0,,üç yüz otuz üç lira, hayatım.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.65,0:00:12.25,Alt,,0,0,0,,Otuz üç de kuruşu var.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.85,0:00:16.10,Alt,,0,0,0,,Amca, burada üç kişi yaşıyorsunuz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:18.70,Alt,,0,0,0,,Bu kadar elektriği kim yaktı ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:20.67,Alt,,0,0,0,,Meydandaki lambalar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.32,0:00:22.72,Alt,,0,0,0,,On iki senedir yanıyor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.17,0:00:24.27,Alt,,0,0,0,,Gerisi faiz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:28.99,Alt,,0,0,0,,Ya tamam, sorun yok!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.19,0:00:30.24,Alt,,0,0,0,,Kapatırız, biter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.64,0:00:31.84,Alt,,0,0,0,,Şalter nerede amca?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.24,0:00:34.19,Alt,,0,0,0,,Muhtarda.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.69,0:00:36.29,Alt,,0,0,0,,Süper!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.89,0:00:38.89,Alt,,0,0,0,,Hemen bir toplantı ayarlayalım muhtarla.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.59,0:00:41.79,Alt,,0,0,0,,Kendisi şurada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.54,0:00:48.39,Alt,,0,0,0,,Rıza… bu muhtar keçi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:50.89,Alt,,0,0,0,,Demokratik bir süreç olmuştur aşkım.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.61,0:00:52.91,Alt,,0,0,0,,Üç oyla seçildi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.61,0:00:54.51,Alt,,0,0,0,,Hadi git konuş.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:00:55.86,Alt,,0,0,0,,Keçiyle mi ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.56,0:00:58.06,Alt,,0,0,0,,Muhtarla, hayatım.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:01.73,KutuKoyu,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,262)\frz2\fad(0,250)\fscx70\fscy70\t(0,140,\fscx106\fscy106)\t(140,220,\fscx100\fscy100)}DEVAMI İÇİN
